    "created_at": "2017-05-16T01:38:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-16T01:38:55Z",
    "body": "> Do clicking on or using keyboard shortcuts to interface with those widgets trigger events? \r\n\r\nNot sure what you mean, but yeah, using keyboard shortcuts in a date input's widget shouldn't fire keyup events. Pressing arrow keys to increment a number input should though, since these are used directly on the input.",
