    "created_at": "2017-05-16T18:57:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-16T18:57:28Z",
    "body": "UIEvents doesn't currently describe these events algorithmically, but when it does that algorithm would be a good place for this info.\r\n\r\nFor now, the info could just be placed in a Note by the event description. Long/medium-term, we want to update UIEvents with proper algorithms.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, I have a bug in UIEvents to track specifying the algorithm for key events: https://github.com/w3c/uievents/issues/142\r\n",
